r\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock3\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16.5 12\"></polyline></svg>3d</span></a><a href=\"https://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><span class=\"research-source\">FA</span><div><strong>Preseason roles, expected line-ups and set pieces</strong><p>Human context for expected minutes, tactical roles and uncertain starting positions.</p></div><span class=\"research-age\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock3\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16.5 12\"></polyline></svg>Monitor</span></a><a href=\"https://fplreview.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><span class=\"research-source\">FP</span><div><strong>Projection and expected-minutes cross-check</strong><p>Compare portal EV with a market-aware external model before locking a transfer.</p></div><span class=\"research-age\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock3\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16.5 12\"></polyline></svg>Deadline</span></a><a href=\"https://www.premierinjuries.com/injury-table.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><span class=\"research-source\">PR</span><div><strong>Availability and potential return dates</strong><p>Verify flags against official club comments; return dates are potential, not guarantees.</p></div><span class=\"research-age\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"curren